TCL files for VCU118 Aparajit

- Change bitfile location from both program_vcu118.tcl and reset_vcu118.tcl whenever bitfile gets updated 


- Run this tcl script only in  nwl_3 system (currently in Research Park Powai Labs)


- If need to run in other systems, change the path of Xilinx Vivado according to that system in program.sh and reset.sh
